# TACIT raw traces are large binary captures; keep the analysis, not the bytes
experiments/tacit/traces/*.out

# Octo port (experiments/octo_port): the Flax param dump (522M), the captured
# JAX intermediates (274M) and the converted torch state_dict (108M) are all
# REPRODUCIBLE from the published checkpoint by dump_jax_ref.py /
# dump_jax_intermediates.py / convert_weights.py. ref/param_tree.json,
# ref/ref_io.npz and ref/ref_ddpm.npz ARE committed: small, and they are the
# evidence the scoping note's numbers and the golden I/O rest on.
experiments/octo_port/ref/params.npz
experiments/octo_port/ref/ref_intermediates.npz
experiments/octo_port/*.pt
